Evoca is seeking an experienced Senior Project Manager who will lead large and complex banking and IT projects, ensuring their comprehensive management, effective collaboration among stakeholders, and timely delivery of results. This position is intended for a specialist with strong banking experience, a good understanding of the IT environment, and the ability to confidently lead cross-functional projects.

